#~ msgid ""
#~ "If the application in the terminal sets the title (most typically people "
#~ "have their shell set up to do this), the dynamically-set title can erase "
#~ "the configured title, go before it, go after it, or replace it. The "
#~ "possible values are \"replace\", \"before\", \"after\", and \"ignore\"."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Ukuba ngaba inkqubo yekhompyutha ekwi-terminal imisela isihloko (abantu "
#~ "abaninzi abanjalo banetoliki yemiyalelo emiselwe ukuba yenze oku), "
#~ "umiselo lwesihloko esinokutshintsha sinokucima isihloko sokumiselwa "
#~ "kwenkqubo yekhompyutha, hamba phambi kwaso, hamba emva kwaso, okanye beka "
#~ "esinye endaweni yaso. Amaxabiso anokwenzeka ngala \"replace\", "
#~ "\"before\", \"after\", kunye no-\"ignore\"."

#~ msgid "If true, allow applications in the terminal to make text boldface."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Ukuba yinyani, vumela inkqubo yekhompyutha kwi-terminal ukwenza ukuba "
#~ "umbhalo ubonakale ungqindilili."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "If true, don't make a noise when applications send the escape sequence "
